OL,3,GNEWSANew Hastings to London fast train
OL,4,Aset for December
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new fast train from Hastings to
OL,7,FLondon is expected to cut peak journey
OL,8,Ftimes by as much as 14 minutes.
OL,10,FRail operator Southeastern said it was
OL,11,Flaunching an express weekday service
OL,12,Ffrom December as part of a wider
OL,13,Ftimetable to deliver more frequent
OL,14,Fservices, better connections and
OL,15,Fincreased capacity across south-east
OL,16,FLondon, Kent and East Sussex.
OL,18,FThe fast train will stop at St Leonards
OL,19,FWarrior Square, Battle, Tunbridge
OL,20,FWells, London Bridge, Waterloo East and
OL,21,FCharing Cross, the firm said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
