OL,3,GNEWSANew Hastings to London fast train
OL,4,Aset for December
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe morning service will leave Hastings
OL,7,Fat 08:05 and arrive at Charing Cross at
OL,8,F09:33, with a return train departing
OL,9,Ffrom Charing Cross at 16:11 and
OL,10,Farriving at Hastings at 17:42, it
OL,11,Fadded.
